      "comment": "OUR ULTIMATE JESSY (5) settled handy then took the lead and kept going in a 1660m race at Albion Park last start, a deserved win on the back of some solid recent performances. This doesn't look as hard so she is a major player again. SWEET NELLIE JOY (1) turned in an uncharacteristically poor run most recently when 21 metres away in 11th over 2138m at Albion Park. Form prior to that had been solid. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Finds a nice race and can make amends. REAL TIN TIN (7) is in the mix following a sixth at his most recent appearance over 1780m at this track. ROCK NIEN (6) could only finish eighth over 1660m at Albion Park most recently. Open to improvement and is in the mix.",
